{"id":"1386da79-64e2-4631-b916-d0da91075de0","object":"chat.completion","created":1784838786,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    core = case['core_distance']\\n    dists = case['distances']\\n    n = len(nodes)\\n    edges = []\\n    for u,v,d in dists:\\n        if u > v:\\n            u,v = v,u\\n        mutual = max(core[u], core[v], d)\\n        edges.append((mutual, u, v))\\n    edges.sort(key=lambda x: (x[0], x[1], x[2]))\\n    parent = {node: node for node in nodes}\\n    rank = {node: 0 for node in nodes}\\n    def find(x):\\n        while parent[x] != x:\\n            parent[x] = parent[parent[x]]\\n            x = parent[x]\\n        return x\\n    def union(x,y):\\n        rx, ry = find(x), find(y)\\n        if rx == ry:\\n            return False\\n        if rank[rx] < rank[ry]:\\n            parent[rx] = ry\\n        elif rank[rx] > rank[ry]:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n        else:\\n            parent[ry] = rx\\n            rank[rx] += 1\\n        return True\\n    mst_edges = []\\n    total = 0.0\\n    for w,u,v in edges:\\n        if union(u,v):\\n            mst_edges.append({'source': u, 'target': v, 'mutual_reachability': w})\\n            total += w\\n            if len(mst_edges) == n-1:\\n                break\\n    return {'edges': mst_edges, 'total_weight': total}\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to produce a JSON with key \"implementation\" and value being a Python source string that defines `solve(case)`. The function should compute mutual reachability MST from the given case payload. The payload has nodes list, core_distance dict, and distances list of [node1, node2, distance]. Compute mutual reachability for each pair as max(core1, core2, distance). Then sort edges by (mutual_reachability, u, v) where u<v canonical order. Run Kruskal's algorithm with union-find to get MST. Return a dictionary with selecte